#: src/apps/settings/panes/PresetsPane.tsx
msgid "A preset is a named assistant: a model, its instructions and its tools. Members pick one in the composer, beside the model."
msgstr "Un preajuste es un asistente con nombre: un modelo, sus instrucciones y sus herramientas. Los miembros eligen uno en el compositor, junto al modelo."

#: src/shell/HelpPage.tsx
msgid "A report is stored with the conversation and answered with a reference you can quote to support. It does not change the conversation, suspend anyone or tell the model anything. If a report could not be stored you are told so, because a report that was never filed must not look like one that was."
msgstr "Un informe se guarda junto a la conversación y se responde con una referencia que puedes citar a soporte. No cambia la conversación, no suspende a nadie ni le dice nada al modelo. Si un informe no pudo guardarse, se te avisa, porque un informe que nunca se presentó no debe parecer uno que sí."

#: src/apps/settings/panes/connections/ConnectSlackWizard.tsx
msgid "A Slack app of your own is created from a manifest MatterWave writes, installed in your workspace, and its token and signing secret pasted back here. Three steps; nothing is answered until a channel is routed."
msgstr "Se crea una app de Slack propia a partir de un manifiesto que escribe MatterWave, se instala en tu espacio de trabajo y su token y su secreto de firma se pegan aquí. Tres pasos; no se responde nada hasta que se enrute un canal."

